<title>PERU: Peru's Industrias Pacocha sets dividend.</title>
<headline>Peru's Industrias Pacocha sets dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's Industrias Pacocha, a subsidiary of Unilever Plc, has set a dividend of 0.0555348 sol per share on first half profits, the Lima Stock Exchange said Friday.</p>
<p>The market said in its daily report that the record date was July 10 and the payout date August 12.</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
